flowchart LR
    subgraph Orchestrator [PR Pipeline DAG]
        S1[Stage 1: Gatekeeper & Lint]
        S2[Stage 2: Build Verification]
        S3[Stage 3: Tests, Security, Docs]
    end

    subgraph DirectFix [Direct Fixes]
        A1[Agent: Fix Metadata via API]
        A2[Agent: Commit Lint Fix to Branch]
    end

    subgraph StackedRemediation [Autonomous Stacked Remediation]
        direction TB
        A4[Agent: Generate Unit Tests]
        A3[Agent / Autofix: Patch Vulns]
        A5[Agent: Generate Docs]
        StackedMerge[Auto-Merge & Link to Parent PR]
    end

    S1 -->|needs-metadata| A1 -->|Update PR| S1
    S1 -->|lint-failed| A2 -->|Commit Fix| S1
    S1 -->|Pass| S2 -->|Pass| S3

    S3 -->|test-required| A4 --> StackedMerge
    S3 -->|security alerts| A3 --> StackedMerge
    S3 -->|docs-required| A5 --> StackedMerge
    StackedMerge -->|Squash, clear label & audit link| S1

    S3 -->|All Pass & Settled| Dispatcher[Stage 4: Review Dispatcher] --> Review[Developer Final Sign-Off & Merge]
